{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"74457d4116697c79055270d210569bbec119cbc1c97cbd6e1571b80ee56c8a3d","ja":"お返しにふさわしい物","zh":"适合作为回礼的东西","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"8edea0b4e54caf2eb73c477d1782d6913ca7f5eff74ac971cf85bd12cacf9ddc","ja":"なるほど。\nふたりとも、バレンタインのお返しで悩んでたのね。","zh":"原来如此。\n你们两个是在为情人节的回礼烦恼啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"cbce46d680dd71a65590badfe150ae71b8f7d4287293e2f8dd1f4aceac343c7e","ja":"はい。学校で、\nファンだという女の子たちからもらいました。","zh":"是的。这是在学校里，\n自称是粉丝的女孩子们送给我的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"554a4b58a703038ac9feb6c24d561cecca491dc862747343186c525e96751cb0","ja":"しかも、とても凝った手作りでした。\nバトントワリングをデザインしたチョコとかです。","zh":"而且做工非常精致。\n像是设计成艺术体操转棒形状的巧克力之类的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3dbc1e2afb96bb89eb5907470273fe16e2c36740ca7cd79c219ff0a98a91a65a","ja":"真壁さんもですか！？　私も、鍵盤型の\nかわいい手作りチョコを、もらってしまって……。","zh":"真壁小姐也是吗！？我也收到了\n可爱的键盘造型手工巧克力……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"066f39ade25445d5444f842e12219627ca6f8e9646f44c44e8326e5c0bef186d","ja":"すごくうれしかったので、\nちゃんとお返しをしたいと思ったんですけど……。","zh":"我感到非常开心，\n想着一定要好好回礼才行……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3e103359f12163b2ba547a48bbb9ae7a2d07282b76655cfdc189347fe3baadbc","ja":"やはり、手作りには手作りで\nお返しをするべきでしょうか？","zh":"果然还是应该用亲手做的东西，\n来作为回礼吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"953e4232e963bd0a01018cecf8249a9fb11faeba19f1c0d2861cbda47c9d6d7c","ja":"うーん……そうしてあげられたら素敵だけど、\n他のファンの子のことを考えると、どうかしら？","zh":"唔……要是能那么做固然很好，\n但考虑到其他粉丝的话，又会如何呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f5f60fbb3ad4b2213ecb5da295d5e01a1c66e7565532cc4a8babf65aa26f3205","ja":"あっ……そうですよね。劇場にもたくさん贈って\nもらいましたけど、すべてにお返しはできませんし。","zh":"啊……也是呢。剧场虽然也收到了\n很多，但确实没办法全部都回礼。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"39fa62d778bf44c3d79c5e2f9ac68d5b287cb9ed771067f9644db66c4130cd5f","ja":"でしょ？　だから、手作りとか、特別感のある\nお返しは避けたほうがいいんじゃないかしら。","zh":"对吧？所以我觉得，最好还是不要送\n亲手制作或是带有特别意味的回礼比较好吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"8acc9c3df1042b88ab50ca371530e0f1d7def33d8bebebc9b581591168d8518b","ja":"それにきっと、学校のみんなは、ふたりから\nもらえること自体を喜んでくれると思うわよ。","zh":"而且我觉得，学校里的大家\n光是能收到你们送的，肯定就会很高兴了哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"bd9407ace872df8feea9f763740885cd2a2be4c431d9c4a1b2e6822408975cc7","ja":"なるほど……手作りじゃなくても、\n感謝の気持ちは伝えられるんですね。","zh":"原来如此……就算不是亲手做的，\n也能传达感激之情呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"0ff58ba6f9114916865c1402cca181500a1fc1707bb423bc61fe0fc2f09d01f7","ja":"それではその分、お菓子選びを頑張ります。\n……おー。","zh":"那我会在挑点心上下更多功夫的。\n……加油～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4f4a02285aaae2836b29172da52a2fee6f3bd63f11690ca657a3204873956fce","ja":"となると、お店選びが重要ね。見た目も味も\nオススメのとこ、いくつか教えてあげられるわよ。","zh":"这样的话，挑店就很重要了呢。外观和味道都\n值得推荐的地方，我能告诉你几家哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"68474a6ba20fbc6028c98c16104a7166de6ea65a7201ffc40359ed353edca922","ja":"ありがとうございます！\nぜひ、お願いします！","zh":"非常感谢！\n那就拜托您了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"cfc52e47df06546576903bbdae82bc4c823bc2e03cfc229b9ad8c69cdd099815","ja":"任せて♪　 あ、それと、お返しって、\nお菓子の種類によって意味がいろいろあるらしいの。","zh":"交给我吧♪　啊，还有，作为回礼，\n根据点心的种类不同，似乎有着各种各样的含义呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"becf5448a4ce1f42c55c139742a98548403a4ac36b697f8413e52f098d30cbb2","ja":"例えばマシュマロだと、ネガティブな意味になるとか。\n中には、気にする子もいるかもしれないでしょ？","zh":"比如送棉花糖的话，可能会带有负面的含义。\n其中说不定也会有孩子会介意吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1536.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e3dc89aefae970f97d4d8fe9163ba84bb364c0a199bc412e127a394a9c677f96","ja":"はい。調べながら選んでみます。\nバッチリなものを見つけるぞ。","zh":"好的。我边查边选选看。\n一定要找到最合适的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
